Needle Assist for Home Assistant (Hebrew)
=========================================

This repository bundles third-party work. Each item keeps the licence it was
published under.


1. The model - custom_components/needle_assist/needle_he.cact
------------------------------------------------------------

A LoRA fine-tune of Needle 2, merged and exported at 4-bit.

    Base model : Cactus-Compute/needle2
                 https://huggingface.co/Cactus-Compute/needle2
    Licence    : Apache License, Version 2.0
                 https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0
    Modified   : yes. Fine-tuned on a generated Hebrew smart-home corpus and
                 exported with `needle build --bits 4`. The base weights are
                 otherwise unaltered.

Apache 2.0 permits redistribution of modified works provided the licence and
this notice of modification travel with them. A full copy of the licence text
is at LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt.


2. The engine - custom_components/needle_assist/needle_engine/
--------------------------------------------------------------

Four files copied byte-for-byte from `cactus-needle` 2.0.5, so that the
integration does not have to declare a dependency that pulls the entire JAX
training stack into Home Assistant. See needle_engine/VENDOR.md for the
reasoning and for the test that keeps the copy honest.

    Source  : https://github.com/cactus-compute/needle
    Licence : MIT
    Copyright (c) 2026 Cactus Compute

The native library `libneedle.so` is NOT bundled. It is downloaded once, on
first setup, from the same public Hugging Face repository, for the exact
architecture and libc of the machine Home Assistant is running on.


